.el .ds Aq '
.TH photocraft-cli-commands 1  "commands " 
.SH NAME
photocraft\-cli\-commands \- List the engine command registry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBphotocraft\-cli commands\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-filter\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the engine command registry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the entries as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-filter\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Only the commands matching this text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
